  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "つきあかりすら　ない　やみよを　とび\nゆだんしている　えものを　おそう。\nくらやみの　たたかいでは　むてきだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "달빛조차 없는 어둠 속을 날며\n방심하고 있는 사냥감을 덮친다.\n어둠 속의 싸움에서는 무적이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les nuits sans lune, il quadrille le ciel à la recherche\nd’une proie. Dans l’obscurité, aucun Pokémon ne peut\nrivaliser avec lui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es fliegt in finsterer, mondloser Nacht umher\nund macht Jagd auf achtlose Beute.\nIst bei Dunkelheit jedem Gegner überlegen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Surca el cielo nocturno cuando ni siquiera la luna brilla\ny ataca a presas incautas. Es imbatible en combates\nque tienen lugar a oscuras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vola nelle notti senza luna e attacca le prede\napprofittando di ogni loro minima distrazione.\nNell’oscurità è invincibile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They fly around on moonless nights\nand attack careless prey. Nothing can\nbeat them in a battle in the dark.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "月明かりすら　ない　闇夜を　飛び\n油断している　獲物を　襲う。\n暗闇の　戦いでは　無敵だ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Surca el cielo nocturno cuando ni siquiera la luna brilla\ny ataca a presas incautas. Es imbatible en combates\nque tienen lugar a oscuras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みみから　はっする　ちょうおんぱで\nきょだいな　いわも　ふんさいする。\nくらやみに　まぎれて　おそいかかる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "귀에서 발생하는 초음파로\n거대한 바위도 분쇄한다.\n어둠을 틈타 공격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut littéralement pulvériser de gros rochers\ngrâce aux ultrasons émis par ses oreilles.\nIl surgit des ténèbres pour attaquer par surprise.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Ultraschallwellen aus seinen Ohren zermalmen\nFelsen zu kleinen Kieseln. Greift stets im Schutz der\nDunkelheit an.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Las ondas ultrasónicas que emite por las orejas\npueden hacer añicos incluso rocas enormes.\nAprovecha la oscuridad para desplegar su ataque.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Grazie agli ultrasuoni che emette dalle orecchie, è in\ngrado di sbriciolare enormi massi. Attacca col favore\ndell’oscurità.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The ultrasonic waves it emits from its ears\ncan reduce a large boulder to pebbles.\nIt swoops out of the dark to attack.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "耳から　発する　超音波で\n巨大な　岩も　粉砕する。\n暗闇に　紛れて　襲いかかる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
