      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "らんぼうな　せいしつだが　こうぶつの\nじゅくした　くだものを　あげると\nてのひらを　かえしたように　なつく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "성질은 난폭하지만 좋아하는\n잘 익은 과일을 주면\n언제 그랬냐는 듯이 잘 따른다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "性情粗暴，但如果給牠\n愛吃的成熟水果，牠就會\n改頭換面似地變得很親近人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "D’ordinaire violent, il vous mange littéralement\ndans la main si vous lui donnez des fruits mûrs,\nson mets favori.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist von Natur aus brutal. Gibt man ihm jedoch\nseine Leibspeise, reifes Obst, ist es plötzlich\nwie ausgewechselt und wird zahm.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es de carácter violento, pero si se le da su\nalimento favorito, una fruta madura, su actitud\ncambia totalmente y se muestra muy dócil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È di indole aggressiva, ma se qualcuno gli\noffre i frutti maturi di cui va matto cambia\ncompletamente atteggiamento e diventa docile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Although it has a violent disposition, if you give\nit a nice ripe fruit that it loves, Noivern will\nsuddenly become tame.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "乱暴な　性質だが　好物の\n熟した　果物を　あげると\n手のひらを　返したように　懐く。",
      "language": {
